    <h1>The Steady Backbone: <em>Anchor</em> Strengths and Careers</h1>
    <p class="dek">If you are the person a team trusts to deliver under load, who holds the standard and rarely drops a ball, Anchor is likely one of your top strengths. Here is what it is, the careers that reward it, how it holds up against AI, and the blind spot that quietly overloads the most dependable people.</p>
